79,3,4,talk,George,,I am satisfied that we have reached this conclusion. It is a victory for the people who keep this university running every day. I am glad we chose the path of necessity.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
